{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23174","headline":"久不见韩侍郎戏题四韵以寄之 · 白居易","name":"久不见韩侍郎戏题四韵以寄之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近来韩合老，疎我我心知。\n户大嫌甜酒，才高笑小诗。\n静吟乖月夜，闲醉旷花时。\n还有愁同处，春风满鬓丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}